    "title": "KBZPay",
    "description": "KBZPay is a mobile wallet powered by KBZ Bank. It's the safer, simpler and more convenient way to transact money in Myanmar. With just a few taps on your phone, whether you wish to pay,transfer, cash in or out.\r\nWith KBZPay App, you can:\r\nQuickly and easily make payment in Merchant stores by scanning QR code or accepting the payment request. Set you free from carrying cash all the time.\r\nTop up your phone in Myanmar anytime, anywhere.\r\nSend money to your family and friends using KBZPay in seconds.\r\nBook Hotels & Tickets for Bus, Flights.\r\nPay your bills with ease from anywhere. Available 24/7 so you never have to wait in line ever again.\r\nSafe and Secure\uff0cLock your KBZPay with Pattern management for an additional set of security.",
